{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node2 to securely pull /etc/inventory/app.conf from node1 every minute. Automatic synchronization and persistence across sequential node restarts were verified successfully.","actions_performed":["Initialized the previously absent source file on node1 without overwriting existing content.","Created a dedicated node2 SSH key restricted on node1 to reading only the source file, with node1’s host key pinned.","Installed an atomic synchronization script and persistent systemd timer on node2.","Demonstrated automatic propagation in under one minute, including after both nodes were restarted.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and verified changed boot identities, service recovery, and data integrity.","Removed the temporary test marker and confirmed final source/destination convergence."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Secure synchronization from node1 to node2","command_ids":["cmd-884e167277674163","cmd-62e055c349c24569","cmd-802d48062a64448a","cmd-161be83717844e65"],"summary":"A restricted SSH read path, pinned host key, atomic destination update, and enabled systemd synchronization timer were established."},{"requirement":"Pick up source changes within 15 minutes","command_ids":["cmd-d1d781b266da47fc","cmd-98d54dc1cc9d4806","cmd-6b10fd5388ac43d5"],"summary":"A node1 change at 09:35:47 was automatically present on node2 by 09:36:31 with matching SHA-256 hashes."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-d08b6d532d5f43d7","cmd-0c87db52bd9644d3","cmd-fe2e38b448dd411b","cmd-a46b54fe27584c8f","cmd-1103971dcd924a71"],"summary":"Node1 reboot acknowledgement was captured; boot ID changed from a0d04bc6-5f90-4c7b-8283-51dd6932056f to 4f40bfe6-90ec-46f0-ab97-69e71b39c1b6. SSH, source data, and node2 access recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-b5ddf073f4f746cf","cmd-5e11d34d586a4816","cmd-de17aff68f5f4b1a","cmd-67cafda6f7df4ed4","cmd-ca92ce98a41943d5"],"summary":"Node2 reboot acknowledgement was captured; boot ID changed from c207ab79-d913-4af0-b630-8f0104ee3ccd to bf492bb6-74bc-415d-9b66-9cf202555608. The timer recovered and completed a successful scheduled post-boot synchronization."},{"requirement":"Final clean state after both restarts","command_ids":["cmd-167c41f512714bb4","cmd-e42e088fd1194b42","cmd-3efbe1b0267148a6","cmd-eb28e38895b74f38","cmd-af90cfadb591470f"],"summary":"The test marker was automatically removed from node2 within 51 seconds. Both systems are running, the timer is enabled and active, and the final source and destination SHA-256 hashes match."}]}
